[
  {
    "text": "A candidate for governor wants",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.6099999999999999,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "every new Alaska data center frozen",
    "start": 1.64,
    "end": 4.029999999999999,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "until lawmakers act.",
    "start": 4.06,
    "end": 5.66,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "Picture that freeze as a gate",
    "start": 6.44,
    "end": 8.05,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "across a road.",
    "start": 8.08,
    "end": 9.06,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "Real gates already stand here.",
    "start": 9.82,
    "end": 11.66,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "Chugach Electric, the Anchorage",
    "start": 12.46,
    "end": 13.99,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "utility, says it doesn't have the",
    "start": 14.02,
    "end": 15.91,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "gas for a big one.",
    "start": 15.94,
    "end": 17.14,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "And since March, Anchorage requires",
    "start": 17.78,
    "end": 19.65,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "proof the power is there.",
    "start": 19.68,
    "end": 21.28,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "Now go north, onto state land,",
    "start": 22.28,
    "end": 24.54,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "where neither reaches.",
    "start": 24.82,
    "end": 25.74,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "This spring Alaska offered a fifty",
    "start": 26.74,
    "end": 28.95,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "year lease for a data center",
    "start": 28.98,
    "end": 30.41,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "burning gas at the wellhead.",
    "start": 30.44,
    "end": 31.96,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "It did that before writing any",
    "start": 32.7,
    "end": 35.01,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "statute on who pays.",
    "start": 35.04,
    "end": 36.28,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "Five hundred Alaskans commented",
    "start": 37.52,
    "end": 39.25,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "on it.",
    "start": 39.28,
    "end": 39.980000000000004,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "Fewer than a dozen were supportive.",
    "start": 40.62,
    "end": 42.48,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "So he's right that there's a",
    "start": 43.42,
    "end": 45.03,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "hole.",
    "start": 45.06,
    "end": 45.760000000000005,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "But Anchorage is one borough.",
    "start": 46.14,
    "end": 47.92,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "Alaska has a patchwork, not a",
    "start": 48.66,
    "end": 51.15,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "process.",
    "start": 51.18,
    "end": 51.88,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "His platform says it's modeled",
    "start": 52.56,
    "end": 54.15,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "on New York's.",
    "start": 54.18,
    "end": 55.14,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "New York's covers only the biggest",
    "start": 55.7,
    "end": 57.79,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "sites, and ends after a year.",
    "start": 57.82,
    "end": 59.74,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "His has no size limit and",
    "start": 61.1,
    "end": 63.01,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "no end date.",
    "start": 63.04,
    "end": 63.76,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "Near Anchorage that adds little,",
    "start": 64.74,
    "end": 66.44,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "since the gas shortage already",
    "start": 66.62,
    "end": 68.01,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "blocks a big one.",
    "start": 68.04,
    "end": 68.94,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "At the wellhead it's the only",
    "start": 70.0,
    "end": 71.53,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "thing in the way, and that",
    "start": 71.56,
    "end": 73.33,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "one makes its own power instead",
    "start": 73.36,
    "end": 75.05,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "of drawing yours.",
    "start": 75.08,
    "end": 75.86,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "Condition it on where the power",
    "start": 77.22,
    "end": 78.83,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "comes from, not on whether the",
    "start": 78.86,
    "end": 80.61,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "building is new.",
    "start": 80.64,
    "end": 81.4,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "Seventeen people are running for",
    "start": 82.5,
    "end": 84.27,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "governor.",
    "start": 84.3,
    "end": 85.0,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "Ask them all two questions.",
    "start": 85.3,
    "end": 86.94,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "What size triggers it, and what",
    "start": 87.96,
    "end": 90.21,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "ends it?",
    "start": 90.24,
    "end": 90.94,
    "seg": 18
  }
]